{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43274","headline":"新阳改故阴 · 纥干讽","name":"新阳改故阴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"律管才推候，寒郊忽变阴。\n微和方应节，积惨已辞林。\n暗觉余澌断，潜惊丽景侵。\n禁城佳气换，北陆翠烟深。\n有截知遐布，无私荷照临。\n韶光如可及，莺谷免幽沈。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"纥干讽","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43274.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43274","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}